# Shadcn UI Rule for TSX Files

- In `app/**/*.tsx` and `components/**/*.tsx`, use shadcn UI components for all UI.
- Avoid creating custom base UI primitives when an equivalent shadcn component exists.
- If a needed shadcn component is not installed, install it with:

```bash
npx shadcn@latest add <component-name>
```

Example:

```bash
npx shadcn@latest add accordion
```
